    $d y Y $.
    isassa.v $e |- V = ( Base ` W ) $.
    isassa.f $e |- F = ( Scalar ` W ) $.
    isassa.b $e |- B = ( Base ` F ) $.
    isassa.s $e |- .x. = ( .s ` W ) $.
    isassa.t $e |- .X. = ( .r ` W ) $.
    $( The properties of an associative algebra.  (Contributed by Mario
       Carneiro, 29-Dec-2014.)  (Revised by SN, 2-Mar-2025.) $)
    isassa $p |- ( W e. AssAlg <-> ( ( W e. LMod /\ W e. Ring )
                   /\ A. r e. B A. x e. V A. y e. V
