        ) ACHIZDHIZFUCUBJKBDLMCGBCENLMMOZPKUDQRSTUA $.
    $}

    psr1bas.k $e |- K = ( Base ` R ) $.
    $( The base set of the ring of univariate power series.  (Contributed by
       Mario Carneiro, 8-Feb-2015.) $)
    psr1bas $p |- B = ( K ^m ( NN0 ^m 1o ) ) $=
      ( vf cn0 c1o cmap co wceq wtru cmps con0 eqid psr1baslem psr1bas2 wcel
      1on a1i psrbas mptru ) ADIJKLZKLMNAUEBJBOLZHJDPUFQZGHRABCUFEFUGSJPTNUAUBU
      CUD $.
  $}

