    $( Cramer's rule.  According to Wikipedia "Cramer's rule", 21-Feb-2019,
       ~ https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cramer%27s_rule :  "[Cramer's rule] ...
       expresses the [[unique] solution [of a system of linear equations] in
