      c0g cbs cmpo df-cpmat a1i simpl fveq2 adantl oveq12d fveq2d oveq2i fveq2i
      eqtri eqtr4di eqeq2d ralbidv raleqbidv rabeqbidv elex fvexi rabexg ovmpod
