      JZLVSUAUBJDUCTVTUBPZUMQZRZHUISZGUAPZSZFWKSZIWKWGUKQZULUGZUNQZUJZWFUFTUFUA
      UBUCTWQUORVSFGHIUAUBUPUQWKJRZWGDRZUEZWQWFRVSWTWMWEIWPAWTWPJDUKQZULUGZUNQZ
      AWTWOXBUNWTWKJWNXAULWRWSURZWSWNXARWRWGDUKUSUTVAVBABUNQXCOBXBUNBJCULUGXBNC
      XAJULMVCVEVDVEVFWTWLWDFWKJXDWTWJWCGWKJXDWTWIWBHUIWTWHWAVTWSWHWARWRWGDUMUS
      UTVGVHVIVIVJUTVQVRURVRDTUDVQDKVKUTATUDWFTUDVSABUNOVLWEIATVMVOVNVP $.

    $d M m $.
    $( A constant polynomial matrix is a polynomial matrix.  (Contributed by
       AV, 16-Nov-2019.) $)
